    "detailed_description": "Introducing &quot;Realm's Edge&quot;, the newest addition to the world of fantasy trading card games!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/404870/extras/43349bdb13d0fd51b27c689fb2e74c46.avif?t=1689095085\" /></div><br>In this game, players take on the role of powerful wizards, each with their own unique set of magical abilities and creatures at their disposal. Assemble your deck from a vast array of creatures, spells, and artifacts, and challenge your opponents in epic battles that will determine the fate of the realm.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/404870/extras/186fbd72f1b347f9eb57afb0edf4e8cd.avif?t=1689095085\" /></div><br>Deck building is a crucial part of Realm's Edge. With over 80 cards to choose from, players can customize their decks to suit their individual play styles and strategies. Do you prefer to unleash hordes of ferocious beasts, or do you prefer to control the battlefield with powerful spells and enchantments? The choice is yours.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/404870/extras/e694f0f781fb9d725389813f0e8693bd.avif?t=1689095085\" /></div><br>But be careful - your opponents will be building their decks just as carefully as you are. You'll need to stay one step ahead if you want to emerge victorious.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/404870/extras/783e530fcecfc055552edf3ff4832c59.avif?t=1689095085\" /></div><br>Each card in Realm's Edge features stunning artwork and unique abilities that will keep you engaged and excited throughout every game. From dragons and wizards to goblins and zombies, the world of Realm's Edge is full of fantastical creatures and powerful magic.<br><br>So gather your friends, choose your wizard, and start building your deck - the fate of the realm is in your hands!",
